 건가...","source_cn":"我们是不是回不去了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD0420620312E69CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064010006:1":{"text":"하지만 여전히 다른 문제가 있어. 라이오스가 아직 두 명이잖아.","source_cn":"而且还是有两个莱欧斯啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x140E444536790177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064010007:1":{"text":"일단 라이오스 문제부터 해결하도록 하지.","source_cn":"那我们就先解决莱欧斯的问题吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7AF49D3AD84B4D41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064010008:1":{"text":"라이오스, 혼돈 이계의 어둠 소환 스튜를 먹어보겠나?","source_cn":"莱欧斯，要不要尝尝混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7EE7BE0AFC57F59A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:11::2":{"text":"혼돈 이계의 어둠 소환 스튜","source_cn":"混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C2E47365F671D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064010009:1":{"text":"당연하지!","source_cn":"当然要尝！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x13EB61B1E0D9C87B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064010010:1":{"text":"무슨 맛일까? 어떤 특별한 효과가 있는 요리야?","source_cn":"不知道尝起来是什么味道？会有什么特殊效果吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x48C07E6069D6C753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064010011:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1064010011":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064010012:1":{"text":"나중에 온 라이오스가 진짜군. 진짜 라이오스는 내 요리를 거절하는 법이 없네.","source_cn":"后面过来的莱欧斯是真的，真正的莱欧斯不会拒绝老夫烹饪的料理。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x57CD5E067826B577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064010013:0":{"text":"계속 우리랑 같이 다녔던 라이오스가 가짜구나!","source_cn":"一直跟着我们的莱欧斯是假的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF81C360860C4EEDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064010014:0":{"text":"너희... 드디어 깨달았구나!","source_cn":"大家……竟然分出来了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x18CD4A69B1E3C50D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064010015:0":{"text":"그럼 넌 누구지? 설마 미치광이 마술사가 보낸 거야?","source_cn":"你是谁？不会真的是狂乱魔法师派来的吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF41F76BD3A05A37C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064010016:0":{"text":"하하하하하, 땡!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈哈，猜错了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4890D4B478533242","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064010017:0":{"text":"아무도 제 정체를 맞추지 못했군요. 저는...","source_cn":"既然没人能猜出我的身份，我——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x11B59F7FB73C300E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1064010017":{"text":"아무도 제 정체를 맞추지 못했군요. 저는...","source_cn":"既然没人能猜出我的身份，我——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x11B59F7FB73C300E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064010018:1":{"text":"가짜 라이오스의 표정이 굳더니 기괴한 웃음을 짓기 시작했다.","source_cn":"假莱欧斯的表情瞬间凝固，随后露出一个诡异的笑容。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF8710B5F676FD29F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064010019:0":{"text":"그리고 라이오스의 몸이 비틀리면서 바뀌더니, 그 자리에 베릴이 나타났다.","source_cn":"他的身形开始扭曲和变化，最终化为了贝利尔的模样。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8BD27D3C9D0B87EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064010020:1":{"text":"아아, 역시 한 번 쓴 속임수는 두 번 통하지 않는 법이네요.","source_cn":"哎呀呀，看来玩过一次的把戏不能再玩第二次了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAC27F48B09B93D5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064010021:1":{"text":"멀린, 여전히 예민하네요. 정말 까다롭다니까요!","source_cn":"梅林，真讨厌！你还是这么敏锐！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xEC17D6DC8523ADC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:34:1064010021":{"text":"멀린, 여전히 예민하네요. 정말 까다롭다니까요!","source_cn":"梅林，真讨厌！你还是这么敏锐！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xEC17D6DC8523ADC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064010022:1":{"text":"나쁜 의도는 없었으니까 오해하지 말아줘요.","source_cn":"别误会，我可没带着什么邪恶目的前来。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xCFBFA732211C4319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064010023:1":{"text":"혼돈류 마물을 소환한다는 소리를 듣고, 재미 삼아 구경하러 온 것뿐이라고요!","source_cn":"只是听说有人要召唤混沌类魔物，特意来看看热闹罢了！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xF094F8ABCDB21D3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064010024:1":{"text":"...하지만 날 흉내내서 모두를 혼란스럽게 만들었잖아.","source_cn":"……但你假扮了我还试图混淆大家。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0CB3BC8CDB6384F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064010025:1":{"text":"근데 라이오스, 어떻게 여기까지 따라온 거야?","source_cn":"不过莱欧斯，你怎么赶过来的？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x19E577E144B102A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064010026:1":{"text":"이상한 쌍둥이를 만났는데, 그 애들이 도와줬어.","source_cn":"我遇到了一对奇怪的双胞胎，他们帮助了我。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAD370588A5A87C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064010027:1":{"text":"젠장, 일리아와 라이라였군요! 전 그냥 이세계에서 온 손님으로 변장해서 장난치고 싶었던 건데!","source_cn":"可恶的伊莱亚和莱拉！我只是想扮成异界来客找点乐子！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x138F94D4D0B25D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_reco